s, and fruits quickly and automatically.\n- Combat and PvP: Includes highly precise Aimbot and movement prediction to secure wins in every duel.\n- Advanced ESP: A completely rewritten and upgraded ESP system that displays players, chests, and rare fruits with high accuracy across long distances, all with zero impact on game performance.\n- Sea Events: Auto-hunts Sea Beasts, Leviathan, and locates Mirage Island automatically.\n- Auto Raids: Clear raids, purchase chips, and awaken your fruits with a single click.\n\nSecurity and Optimization\n\n- Quantum Shield Protection: Equipped with strong encryption layers and advanced anti-cheat bypass mechanisms to minimize ban rates and keep your account secure.\n- Lag-Free and Optimized: Highly lightweight and designed to run efficiently on both mobile and PC hardware without consuming excessive CPU, GPU, or RAM resources.\n- Hot-Fixes and Updates: Continuous maintenance and instant updates to ensure the script remains fully functional after every game patch.\n\nHow to Use\n\n1. Copy the script from the official server.\n2. Open your preferred executor.\n3. Click Inject, then Execute, and dominate the server.\n\nNote: The script supports English and Vietnamese localizations and is fully compatible with all modern executors.","tags":["blox","fruit","farm","auto farm","blox fruit"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/WHyPDFas","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69440f7349abd0da144e6f10","username":"basharkk","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ac14d68479ade2971d2b9cc79ae816bdebf8a139480cf63f5f507cafa72afdb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69440f7349abd0da144e6f10-1782206218185.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69440f7349abd0da144e6f10","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8ac14d68479ade2971d2b9cc79ae816bdebf8a139480cf63f5f507cafa72afdb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69440f7349abd0da144e6f10-1782206218185.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"csta